<title>SRI LANKA: Agalawatte nine-month net up.</title>
<headline>Agalawatte nine-month net up.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Agalawatte Plantations Ltd for the nine months to September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(In millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			 9 months 1996	    9 months 1995</p>
<p>    Turnover	     414.43	vs	   359.29</p>
<p>    Net profit	    47.82	vs	    36.41</p>
<p>NOTE - Agalawatte Plantations is one of six estate firms privatised in 1995.</p>
<p>($1 = 56.6 rupees)</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
